'''[[wikipedia: Algebra|Algebra]]''' is a unique [[Technology (Age of Empires IV)|technology]] available to the [[Abbasid Dynasty]] in ''[[Age of Empires IV]]'' that can be researched at the [[House of Wisdom]] (with the [[House of Wisdom#Abbasid Dynasty|Culture Wing]] upgrade) starting in the [[Feudal Age (Age of Empires IV)|Feudal Age]]. After researching, the House of Wisdom begins generating {{Resources|food = 1|wood = 1|gold = 0.67}} every 20 seconds for every military technology researched. This includes [[Boiling Oil (Age of Empires IV)|Boiling Oil]], [[Siege Directive]], and all technologies from the following buildings:
* {{4icons|Barracks}}
* {{4icons|Archery Range}}
* {{4icons|Stable}}
* {{4icons|Siege Workshop}}
* {{4icons|Blacksmith}}
* {{4icons|University}} (including Court Architects)
* {{4icons|Dock}} (except fishing-related technologies)
* {{4icons|Military Wing}}

For production buildings, it includes unit upgrades. It does not include [[Mosque (Age of Empires IV)|Mosque]] technologies or [[emplacement]]s. The maximum that can be generated is {{Resources|food = 58|wood = 58|gold = 38.67}} every 20 seconds, or {{Resources|food = 174|wood = 174|gold = 116}} per minute.

If [[Preservation of Knowledge]] has been researched, this technology costs -20%. 

